    description: "Zenodo DOI for the TIDE software release."
abstract: "TIDE is a SimNIBS-based research pipeline for tractography-informed estimation of individualised transcranial magnetic stimulation intensity using motor-threshold calibration and the gradient activating function along subject-specific streamlines."
